================================================================================

Most useful information is inside:

book.volumeInfo


Book information:

--------------------------------+--------------------------------------+------------------
Information                     | Property                             | Data Type
--------------------------------+--------------------------------------+------------------
Book ID                         | book.id                              | String
Title                           | book.volumeInfo.title                | String
