Publisher                       | book.volumeInfo.publisher            | String
Published Date                  | book.volumeInfo.publishedDate        | String
Description                     | book.volumeInfo.description          | String
Page Count                      | book.volumeInfo.pageCount            | Number
Categories                      | book.volumeInfo.categories           | Array
Thumbnail                       | book.volumeInfo.imageLinks.thumbnail | String
Preview Link                    | book.volumeInfo.previewLink          | String
--------------------------------+--------------------------------------+------------------


Examples:

book.volumeInfo.title

-> "JavaScript: The Good Parts"


book.volumeInfo.authors

-> ["Douglas Crockford"]


book.volumeInfo.pageCount

-> 172


