11. DISPLAY AUTHORS
================================================================================

The API returns authors as an array.

Example:

"authors": [
  "Robert C. Martin",
  "Michael Feathers"
]


Convert the array to text:

book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ')


Result:

Robert C. Martin, Michael Feathers


Recommended JSX:

<p>

  <strong>Author:</strong>{' '}

  {book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ')
    || 'Unknown Author'}

</p>


================================================================================
12. DISPLAY DESCRIPTION
================================================================================

Descriptions may be very long.

Instead of displaying the entire description:

{book.volumeInfo?.description}


Display only part of it:

{book.volumeInfo?.description
  ? `${book.volumeInfo.description.substring(0, 150)}...`
  : 'No description available'}


Explanation:

- Checks whether description exists.
- substring(0, 150) keeps the first 150 characters.
- Adds "..." after truncated text.
- Displays fallback text when description is missing.


