14. DISPLAY GOOGLE BOOKS PREVIEW LINK
================================================================================

Some books contain:

book.volumeInfo.previewLink


Render the link only when it exists:

{book.volumeInfo?.previewLink && (

  <a
    href={book.volumeInfo.previewLink}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    className="btn btn-primary btn-sm"
  >
    View Book
  </a>

)}


Explanation:

- href contains the preview URL.
- target="_blank" opens it in another tab.
- rel="noopener noreferrer" is appropriate for links opening a new tab.
- btn creates Bootstrap button styling.
- btn-primary gives the button the primary color.
- btn-sm creates a smaller button.


