24. WHAT THE COMPLETE CODE DOES
================================================================================

BookList Props:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- books
  Contains books returned by the API.

- isLoading
  Indicates whether the API request is still running.

- error
  Contains an error message when fetching fails.

- searchTerm
  Contains the current book search.


Loading Check:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (isLoading)

- Stops normal book rendering.
- Displays the loading message.


Error Check:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (error)

- Displays the error.
- Prevents invalid results from being displayed.


Empty Check:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (books.length === 0)

- Detects an empty search result.
- Displays "No books found."


map():
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

books.map((book) => ...)

- Runs once for every book.
- Generates one card for every book.


volumeInfo:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const info = book.volumeInfo || {};

- Creates a shorter variable for book data.
- Prevents repeated book.volumeInfo references.


Book ID:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

key={book.id}

- Provides React with a stable list identifier.


Image:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

info.imageLinks?.thumbnail

- Displays the image only if one exists.


Title:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

info.title || 'No Title'

- Displays the real title when available.
- Otherwise displays "No Title."


Authors:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

info.authors?.join(', ') || 'Unknown Author'

- Converts author array into readable text.
- Provides fallback when authors are missing.


Description:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

info.description.substring(0, 150)

- Truncates long descriptions.


Preview:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

info.previewLink

- Displays the Google Books button only when a preview URL exists.


Responsive Grid:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3

- Mobile  -> 1 card
- Small   -> 2 cards
- Medium  -> 3 cards
- Large   -> 4 cards


