Better:

book.volumeInfo?.authors?.join(', ')
  || 'Unknown Author';


PROBLEM: AUTHORS DISPLAY AS AN ARRAY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Instead of:

{info.authors}


Use:

{info.authors?.join(', ')}


